    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "26351c2a9fb1fa89058408cbeed63c7996c6ebb9106ece9bd2225e55b77ff783",
      "text": "After breakfast, a half-day excursion (4 hours) to one of Rio’s most famous landmarks. A cable car takes you to Sugar Loaf, stopping first at Urca Hill before continuing to the summit, with spectacular panoramic views of Guanabara Bay, Copacabana Beach, the surrounding mountains, the islands along the coast, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and Christ the Redeemer in the distance.\n\nThe excursion continues through the historic centre, with its colonial buildings, churches, monasteries and the impressive Metropolitan Cathedral. The rest of the afternoon is at leisure: relax on the beach, stroll along the promenades of Copacabana or Ipanema, or simply soak up the vibrant atmosphere of the Marvellous City.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
